			"notes": "This is an alpha version of 1.2.0, which compared to the previous version, adds emoji support and better refactored code.\n\nI usually wouldn't release this, but due to my loss of interest in Minecraft I want to bring the releases up to speed with the current codebase of the repo. I'm focusing on making other stuff, which is why Unikko will enter a hiatus, with a possibility of future Minecraft version bumps. Even though this project might be small, simple, and full of not-so pristine code, I've still learned a lot from it.\n\nThanks to the something like three people who've had the courage to actually install and run this mod! （あなた達が最高！！）"
		},
